PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Mace_(Uncommon)\" title=\"Infernal Mace (Uncommon)\">Infernal Mace</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Spear\" title=\"Infernal Spear\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Spear_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Spear_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Spear_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Spear_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Spear_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Spear_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Spear_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Spear_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Spear_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Spear\" title=\"Infernal Spear\">Infernal Spear</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Warhammer\" title=\"Infernal Warhammer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Warhammer\" title=\"Infernal Warhammer\">Infernal Warhammer</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(inaccessible)</i></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aischa\" title=\"Aischa\">Aischa</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Borri_Paver\" title=\"Borri Paver\">Borri Paver</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Greyward\" title=\"Greyward\">Greyward</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hahns_Rives\" title=\"Hahns Rives\">Hahns Rives</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hyrriet\" title=\"Hyrriet\">Hyrriet</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ifran\" title=\"Ifran\">Ifran</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ignur\" title=\"Ignur\">Ignur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Indora_Ralston\" title=\"Indora Ralston\">Indora Ralston</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mian\" title=\"Mian\">Mian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mohlen\" title=\"Mohlen\">Mohlen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nuff\" title=\"Nuff\">Nuff</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tamia_Holzt\" title=\"Tamia Holzt\">Tamia Holzt</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Uva\" title=\"Uva\">Uva</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vengeful_Merregon\" title=\"Vengeful Merregon\">Vengeful Merregon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Volgu_Drak\" title=\"Volgu Drak\">Volgu Drak</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The roll for the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\">Poisoned</a> saving throw is not shown in the combat log for either a successful or failed save. Because it has a low <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;12 Constitution Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;12 <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>, this can give the impression that the poison effect does not work at all.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202129\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.104 secon